          "benefits_md": "Cash Incentives @ ₹12,500/hectare.\n",
          "briefDescription": "The \"Subsidy for Cultivation of Fodder Crops\" scheme was introduced by the Department of Agriculture and Farmer's Welfare, Union Territory of Puducherry. Through this scheme, cash incentives are distributed to Farmers and Self Help Groups for undertaking fodder cultivation in the Puducherry region.",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "The \"Subsidy for Cultivation of Fodder Crops\" component of the \"Crop Production Technology\" scheme was introduced by the Department of Agriculture and Farmer's Welfare, Union Territory of Puducherry. Through this scheme, cash incentives are distributed to Farmers and Self Help Groups for undertaking fodder cultivation in the Puducherry region."
                }
